WEBVTT

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.840
You're all scum...

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.560
You and Professor Takashi...

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.390
Ryo, do you think
Professor Takashi's daughter is a reaper?

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.690
A "reaper"?

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:27.190
Ango. Let's go.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:30.730
Yes, there's no water
that we can use around here.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.530
We need to get back
and either make a reservoir or dig a well.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.500
GREATER HEAT

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:18.380
<i>I wonder what Mr. Aramaki
and the rest of them all think...</i>

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.220
<i>about me?</i>

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:32.860
<i>There has to be something
in my stuff that they left for me.</i>

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.280
<i>The "Mr. Takashi"
who chose to cull so many people.</i>

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.660
<i>The "Professor Takashi"
who did horrible things to Ango's team.</i>

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:45.950
<i>I want to say my dad wasn't like that,
but I can't.</i>

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.870
Didn't they tell you anything, Hana?

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:50.830
What?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:55.880
Didn't your parents tell you where to go
or what to do after you got here?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.590
Didn't they give you a hint?

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.430
A hint? No, nothing like that.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.220
When I really think about it,
I hardly know anything about my dad.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.060
I never even saw him
work at his government job.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:14.020
And I never knew where my mother went
when she left for her lessons.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:15.940
Really?

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.110
Well, let me know
if you remember anything.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.960
Dig. Make a well all by yourself.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.130
You cheated your way here.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.050
Now make up for
what your bastard of a father did.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.180
No slacking off.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.820
<i>Dad, what did you do
to Ango and the others?</i>

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.320
<i>Didn't you consider
that I might meet them here?</i>

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:04.320
<i>Didn't you even think about
what they would do to me?</i>

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.890
Were you hoping to trap me down there?
Too bad.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.890
It's still light out.
Get back down there and dig.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.360
It's even pitch black under my nails.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.790
We're taking down the shower.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:58.420
We're limiting the use of the bath too,
so decide who gets to use it first.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.130
We're going to pool
our remaining water in a reservoir.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.170
Get out.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.090
Quit it! What's wrong with you? Get out!

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:08.760
Don't look! Quit standing there!
Get out right now!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.230
Goddamn it!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:43.710
What? You're leaving?

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:46.170
Yes, sometime tomorrow.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.840
No matter how much I dig,
I'll never strike water.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:51.140
Even with a reservoir, it may not last.

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.350
With one less person,
the water will last longer.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:57.850
<i>And if I stay here,
I'm sure Ango will kill me.</i>

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.520
Why don't you invite me to come with you?

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:03.150
Mr. Aramaki...

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:05.190
But, I mean...

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:10.700
Even if your father put us all here,
I don't believe his intent was malicious.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.410
The diary made that clear.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.080
Regardless of whether
it was right or wrong,

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.750
your parents risked their lives
to uphold their duty.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.040
I have no hatred for them.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.710
And you shouldn't either, Ms. Hana.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.220
We're all in the same boat.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.180
The fact that you're here right now,

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.800
is proof that your parents loved you
more than anything.

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:36.600
Mr. Aramaki...

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.480
What are you two getting emotional about?

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.020
You sure are good at this kind of thing,
Mr. Aramaki.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:46.570
I'm coming with you too, Hana.
And I'm sure Momota will, too.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:47.820
Haru...

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:51.070
Then we'll go and search for
Fujiko and the others.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.910
I suspect that we'll find some water
if we keep heading south.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.200
Okay.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.830
You're running off, Hana?

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:07.590
Yes, I am. That would be best
for both of us, don't you think?

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:11.380
I won't let you!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.890
You'll work here until you die
to pay back what you owe!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:17.560
Could you please
stop looking at me like that?

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:22.020
I'd like to hear more about my dad,
but I can't stand talking to you.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.480
My presence is a source of pain for you,
that's why I'm leaving.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.190
So just let me go.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.330
What was that for? That...

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.000
I told you, you'll pay back what you owe.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:53.130
<i>Wait a damn minute.
That's what you're after?</i>

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:58.010
You can't be serious! Stop it!
Get your hands off! Don't touch me!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.180
<i>Arashi!</i>

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.060
That was a big mistake, bitch.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.110
They ruined all our fun because of you.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.110
You got off easy.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:12.740
Bitches like you
need to be caged and trained.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.610
We'll make you nice and obedient.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.160
Hana!

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.410
Arashi!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:24.170
<i>Back then, Arashi came for me.
He saved me.</i>

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.920
<i>But now, he's not here.
Arashi can't help me!</i>

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.090
You sicko! Get off!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.880
Blame your father.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:37.510
Fuck you.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.270
You're never going to break me like this.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.180
I'll never give in to the likes of you!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:48.310
Ryo told me to stop you

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.030
because you couldn't keep yourself
from killing that girl.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.820
But I guess his concern was misplaced,
wasn't it?

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.030
Ryo did?

00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:01.370
I didn't realize that you knew
how to truly torture a woman.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:05.040
Try not to be
a perverted old bastard, Ango.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.250
I'll want to kill you.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.230
He tore off a lot of the buttons.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:30.610
I'll have to go back for them later.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:39.240
Goddamn it! Shit! That bastard!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.750
Arashi...

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.830
Arashi...

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.420
Please come and hold me...

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.130
You stabbed me!

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:58.510
When you threaten others with a knife,
you had better be prepared to be killed.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.390
You asshole!

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.600
-You prick!
-Arashi! Stop it!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.730
You'll kill them!

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.060
I don't care.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:13.940
I don't care about them either,
but you could get hurt, Arashi.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:17.150
As long as you're okay,
it doesn't matter what happens to me.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.200
<i>Arashi isn't here.</i>

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.160
<i>He can't comfort me with his embrace.</i>

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.920
The ship is stuck on something.
We can't get through here.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.170
Then we need to back up.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:36.970
But how the hell do we do that?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.050
I guess we're just plain stuck.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:41.930
The wind isn't even blowing either.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:47.390
Hold on a minute.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:48.980
Arashi?

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:53.360
Hey, Hibari.

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:58.150
You seem pretty unconcerned
that your cousin Hotaru is in danger.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:00.410
I'm concerned about her, of course.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:04.160
My grandmother charged me with
protecting that land, even in the future.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:07.290
I just never imagined
they would send Hotaru here, too.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.370
"That land"?

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.290
Arashi...

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.960
Natsu! Semimaru! Come over here!

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.920
I saw Team Autumn's village! This is Kobe!

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:17.920
Team Autumn?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:20.050
Oh, crap! We have to deal with
those guys again?

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:24.680
Everything is in ruins.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.890
It's been wiped out by ash and heavy rain.

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:29.480
They worked so hard to build it.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.230
Mr. Izayoi! Is anyone here?

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.060
They must have evacuated.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:36.980
Oh, thank god they're not here.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.070
I'll check out their storage shelter.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.700
Natsu, go check for anything on that side.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:42.610
Okay.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:45.280
Watch where you step!

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:48.080
It might be dangerous
to go inside the buildings!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:51.000
<i>Arashi is always so nice.</i>

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.500
There's nothing here.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.760
<i>Dear Arashi. This is Hana.</i>

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:08.470
<i>I'm here as part of Team Spring.</i>

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:11.520
<i>Our team's camp is on Mt. Kyogatake
in the Kanto region,</i>

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.650
<i>but I came here in search of you.</i>

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.560
<i>If you find this,
please leave something behind for me.</i>

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:19.150
<i>Arashi, I believe we'll meet again.</i>

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:21.070
<i>Yours, Hana Sugurono.</i>

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.570
Natsu, did you find anything?

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.410
Natsu.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:34.710
We should get out of here.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.380
The buildings are starting to fall apart.

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:42.970
This village is done for.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.140
<i>If I don't give it to him now...</i>

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.180
Hey! Is anybody here?

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:50.890
Arashi...

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.940
<i>If I don't give it to him now,
it will look like I was hiding it.</i>

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.650
<i>I can't show it to him later.
I won't be able to explain it.</i>

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.780
<i>But I've already missed my chance.</i>

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.410
<i>Now I'll have to pretend I never saw it.</i>

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:09.700
Well, now, what do we have here, Nat?

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.870
I thought you were acting weird.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.250
So that's what you were hiding.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.210
Natsu, come on.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:22.800
I'm talking to you!

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.140
Calm down, it's not like
I'm going to spill the beans.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:30.390
That was a sweet trick you pulled.

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:33.020
I'm starting to find you amusing.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:37.560
I mean, think about it.
Back when we first woke up,

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:40.020
you would've just given it to him, right?

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.360
That's what made you so boring.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:44.780
Now, you don't care what anybody thinks.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:50.370
Your personality has some depth now.
I almost want to throw you a party.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:54.200
But, hey. You still have to
hand this over to Arashi.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:14:00.290
And for the record, I think you've got
the wrong impression about this.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:03.250
You think you're in love with Arashi,

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:08.220
but you just have a crush on him because
he's the first guy who's been nice to you.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:11.800
If I was nice,
you would've fallen for me too, you know.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:19.100
Hey, don't act like I never had a chance!
That hurts!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:21.940
Nat? Is that you?

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:24.110
Matsuri? Mr. Mozu?

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.990
I'm so glad to see you!

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:31.240
What happened? Why are you here?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.870
There's trouble!
Ms. Botan and the others are about to die!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.080
What?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.630
You're sure this is the place?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:43.710
Yes.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.300
This used to be some kind of building.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.510
This is way different
from what you said, Hibari.

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:51.010
I thought it was further west.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:52.050
Semimaru!

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:55.180
That chick was trying to
keep us away from here.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.770
She clearly doesn't care about Hotaru.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.850
You know that's not true.

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.770
Don't make assumptions like that
just because she looks calm.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:07.150
You're the one
who's always making assumptions, Arashi!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.860
-What?
-Your personality is so damn shallow.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.570
Oh, dear... Stop it, you guys!

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.120
You sure got the energy.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.580
You got a problem, dude?

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.330
No, I'm just surprised.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:20.290
This is no time to be fighting!
We've got to save the others!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.670
Natsu, you're the lightest. Go first.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.590
I found them!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:34.180
<i>I was crying and working so hard,
that it wasn't until later that I realized</i>

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:37.720
<i>I had completely forgotten about
the letter from Hana.</i>

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.190
Ms. Botan! Thank god!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.350
Thank you, Matsuri.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:46.360
You seem pretty healthy
despite going without any food or water.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:51.360
It's strange. It felt so comfortable
in there that it was hard to stay awake.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.200
I see. It's sweet.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:59.750
It's like a scale insect secretion.
It has high sugar content.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:03.120
In other words, even though
it sucked out your bodily fluids,

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:08.710
the sugars entered your body
almost like an IV drip.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:10.420
I need a bath.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:11.510
A bath?

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.180
And I would like to let my hair down.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:16.430
There's a waterfall of clean water
over that way.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.350
Hibari?

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.850
So you came to the future too, Hotaru.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.240
Dang!

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.820
Ms. Botan?

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.070
Big Sis!

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:40.750
I can't stand it anymore, Sis!
Please let me do it with you just once!

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:41.750
Semimaru!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.250
Fine by me.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.370
For real?

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.750
But if I get pregnant,
are you ready to be a father?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:47.840
What?

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.840
You need to understand that,
in this world, sex is for making children.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.510
Boys, think it over.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:59.350
You can deal with your urges by either
suppressing them or acting on them.

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:02.020
Girls, think it over carefully.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:06.850
Getting pregnant here may very well
cost you your life.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:10.820
It also means that you'll have to raise
a child in this world.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.690
How about it, Semimaru?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.610
If you're ready for all that,
then let's do it.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:18.780
No. Maybe some other time.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.410
Have you given birth before?

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.210
I've been pregnant before, yes.

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.420
I was also married.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.840
In my last month of pregnancy,
I got hit by a drunk driver.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.090
I survived, but the baby did not.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.720
I suppose the only good thing
about this world

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.260
is that there are no drunk drivers.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.730
Things with my husband fell apart
after that and we divorced.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:49.940
He remarried, and I came here.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:55.950
In the end, I think he and his wife
were happy together.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.380
It's just like a lantern festival.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:10.710
The one in Kumamoto?

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:11.790
Yes.

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.380
You've been to it?

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.840
I've lived in a lot of different places.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:20.470
Japanese festivals. The Bon Dance.
They all make me feel nostalgic.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.860
I'm going to dance, too.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.370
Me, too!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.700
Next, play the Koshu festival song.

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:47.040
What? No way!
The Hamamatsu festival song is next!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:50.000
I don't know either of those.
We'll do "Tokyo Ondo" instead.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.250
I'm a fan of "Sado Okesa" myself.

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:54.300
So you're from Sado, Hotaru?

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.170
Who's a "sado"? I'm a "masochist."

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:02.600
Do you mind if I ask you a question?

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:08.600
Why did you wish for your ex
and his new wife to be happy?

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:12.480
Isn't it natural for us to want
the person we love to be happy?

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.940
But what if they're happy...

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.820
and you're not?

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:22.530
It's better than being happy
while the person I love is miserable.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:29.080
Hey, Natsu, you're actually
looking me in the eye for once.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:33.330
What? Well, you're not as scary today
as you usually are.

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:34.590
Is that so?

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:35.880
Sorry.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:38.590
Well, I think you've matured a little.

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:47.560
Oh, Arashi?

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:54.060
Here.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:20:01.360
Arashi! I was hiding that from you,
but Natsu insisted that I fork it over.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:02.280
Semimaru...

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.790
Isn't it great news
that your girlfriend is fine? So...

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:11.960
What?

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.080
He isn't even listening.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:17.290
Hana...

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.600
Is something wrong, Ms. Hana?

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.400
I'm just slacking off.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.570
Digging that well is a lot of work.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:46.570
Forget about tomorrow.
We should leave the village tonight.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:48.200
No, I'm okay.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.540
You're clearly not okay.

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:56.830
<i>If Ango finds out, he'll stop us.
I have to be stealthy.</i>

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.460
Oh, Hana, you're hurt.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:03.720
Thank you.
I was a little reckless earlier.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.180
Digging a well isn't easy, right?

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:08.100
Are you feeling a bit better now?

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:10.390
I guess that's a silly question.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:13.930
Sorry, I wish I could do more.

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:16.560
I thought that maybe it was best
to just give you some space.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.820
None of us really knew what to say to you.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.360
Just ignore Ango and the rest of them.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.030
You didn't do anything wrong, Hana.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.330
Hey, Ryuusei.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.660
Crap! Busted!
I was just taking a break, that's all.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.460
You take good care of Kurumi, okay?

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.710
What was that about?

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:44.630
Mr. Karita.

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:46.130
Yes?

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:49.640
Please be wary of Ango,
and keep all of the women safe.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.180
I'm keeping my eyes on him.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:53.520
I haven't forgotten
what he did to Mr. Izayoi.

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:55.640
I'm also keeping an eye on him.

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:57.480
Thank you.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.740
<i>All set. I'll slip out
when everyone has fallen asleep.</i>

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:09.450
Hey, Hana.

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.950
Come with me. Right now.

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:15.040
We're going to descend into a cave
to try and find more water.

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:16.960
You're coming with us.
